      "title": "New Player Experience: Perfect Partners Vol. 2",
      "how_to_play": "<div style=\"font-size: 13px;\">\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Gameplay Rules</strong></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The total probability is 100%, with a guaranteed prize for every draw. All styles in the 'Card Album' are eligible to be drawn from this box. Results are generated randomly by the system (see 'Card Album' for probabilities), unaffected by time or users. Every participant hahas an equal chance. All draw chances are generated fairly and randomly and no manual interference required.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Card Collection Mode</strong></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. An additional collection feature is included. By collecting cards of specific levels, users can redeem rewards upon completion.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. Progress is automatically tracked through draws; no manual action needed.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"6\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3. Rewards are divided into four tiers: Common, Advanced, Exclusive, and Supreme. Each tier has different collection criteria and reward content.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"7\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">4. Once a tier&rsquo;s conditions are met, the user can click 'Claim Reward' to redeem the corresponding prize.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">5. After claiming a reward, <span style=\"color: #d83931;\">all collection progress resets </span>and a new round begins.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"9\" data-line=\"true\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"10\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Shipping Instructions</strong></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"11\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">All prizes are 100% authentic, sourced from official brands or authorized dealers. Shipping fees vary by location. Prizes will be shipped within 1&ndash;15 working days (refer to User&rsquo;s location and stock availability). You can track the shipping status in &lsquo;Orders&rsquo; section on the platform.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"12\" data-line=\"true\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"13\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Important Notes</strong></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"14\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. Minor scratches, edge curls, color overflow, or burrs due to production and packaging are considered normal and not eligible for return/exchange.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"15\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. Due to limitations of physical card types, the lowest level card shipped will be one random regular card from the current series. Other levels are unaffected.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"16\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3. Users under 18 years old are not allowed to make purchases.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"17\" data-line=\"true\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"18\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">*Apple is not a sponsor of this event, nor is it involved in any way.</span></div>\n</div>",
